OL,3,GNEWSAGWR workers vote in favour of
OL,4,Astrike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome Great Western Railway (GWR)
OL,7,Fworkers have voted to strike in a row
OL,8,Fover pay and working arrangements.
OL,10,FMembers of the Transport Salaried
OL,11,FStaffs Association working in areas
OL,12,Fsuch as rostering, service delivery and
OL,13,Fperformance strategy are involved in
OL,14,Fthe dispute.
OL,16,FThe union said separate votes in
OL,17,Fdifferent areas of the business showed
OL,18,Fstrong support for strikes and other
OL,19,Findustrial action but no walkouts had
OL,20,Fbeen scheduled yet.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
