OL,3,GNEWSAGWR workers vote in favour of
OL,4,Astrike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GWR spokesperson said: "We continue
OL,7,Fto work with colleagues and their
OL,8,Ftrades union representatives to find a
OL,9,Fmutually beneficial solution to the
OL,10,Fdispute and avoid damaging strike
OL,11,Faction."
